{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>出道5年的炎明熹強勢入圍叱咤女歌手金獎大熱名單，與眾多實力派女歌手正面交鋒。為了乘勝追擊，她宣佈在12月舉辦首張大碟發佈派對並推出1,280元門票套裝，為年底頒獎禮投下震撼彈。這個關鍵時刻出大招的舉動無疑令今屆樂壇戰局充滿未知數。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹首度入圍叱咤女金大熱乘勢舉辦大型新碟派對</h2>\n<p>炎明熹在早前的頒獎典禮記者會上罕有以性感造型亮相驚豔全場，更憑藉轉會後的強勁音樂走勢，首度入圍「叱咤樂壇女歌手金獎」大熱名單。面對激烈的競爭環境，她定於12月6日下午5時於新蒲崗PORTAL舉行大型發佈派對，與樂迷近距離接觸。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹推首張大碟記錄5年蛻變心路歷程積極衝擊獎項</h2>\n<p>獲得極大創作自由度後，炎明熹正式宣佈推出首張個人專輯《Still, the Lightness?》，親自透過音樂回應外界關注。新碟概念圍繞她在這5年成長路上的內心探索，邀請樂迷並肩同行在歌聲中尋找答案。公司安排在這個投票計分關鍵時刻舉辦活動及發行專輯，明顯是為了推高人氣與話題度，強勢為年尾頒獎典禮造勢。</p>\n<h2>限量版門票套裝明日正式公開發售勢必掀起粉絲瘋狂搶票潮</h2>\n<p>為了配合全新心血結晶面世，活動推出定價為1,280元的門票組合，當中包含全企位入場門票一張，更一次過附送專輯兩個版本各一張。套裝將於明日即11月27日早上11時於官方網上平台正式發售，消息一出隨即引起網上熱烈討論。大批網民在討論區留言表示「終於等到出大碟必定要入場全力支持」，亦有忠實擁躉擔憂直指「企位門票數量有限絕對要提早準備瘋狂㩒飛」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298233666919_11520999776b07cb9719c6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sonymusichk_1795586473_4037989314771880344_281268096.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298233666919_11520999776b07cb9719c6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298537959256_3713046956b07cb99c25d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"yiminghay_1785245403_3951233405837050950_43694366521.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298537959256_3713046956b07cb99c25d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298698143669_1824446616b07cb9b62ec7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"yiminghay_1783766938_3938843552964783277_43694366521.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179567298698143669_1824446616b07cb9b62ec7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:21:50.158104+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:03:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:20.937469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:16.723652+00:00","content_hash":"09857b9271c3c3ad8a2ba0337a5671897c4cbc7775b08676d1814eaa34d6c9b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}